{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/extras/blood_pickup_gif.gif?t=1747607378\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mystery and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A town is being bled dry by a hidden cult, and every drop of blood fuels their dark magic. Tear through their ranks before they amass enough blood to usher in a new world order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Them All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Dominic, a man with the unique ability to eject blades from his wrists, and Darius, a mage that picks up the blood of fallen foes and uses it to cast devastating magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use each character's unique skill set to slash, stab, punch, and beam your way through the cult's compounds. Use stealth tactics to get the jump on your enemies, or confront them head on, odds be damned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/extras/demo_gif2.gif?t=1747607378\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beginning of Dominic's story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 9 of the game's 57 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as 2 of the game's 7 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the game's first 3 bosses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331150?t=1747607378","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331150?t=1747607378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/4b585873dbe96f50b7cfe22dfe355fba0688105c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747607378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/4b585873dbe96f50b7cfe22dfe355fba0688105c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747607378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent intense acts of violence, blood and gore, profanity, references to tobacco, depictions of cuts on wrists"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/extras/blood_pickup_gif.gif?t=1747607378\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mystery and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A town is being bled dry by a hidden cult, and every drop of blood fuels their dark magic. Tear through their ranks before they amass enough blood to usher in a new world order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Them All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Dominic, a man with the unique ability to eject blades from his wrists, and Darius, a mage that picks up the blood of fallen foes and uses it to cast devastating magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use each character's unique skill set to slash, stab, punch, and beam your way through the cult's compounds. Use stealth tactics to get the jump on your enemies, or confront them head on, odds be damned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331150/extras/demo_gif2.gif?t=1747607378\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beginning of Dominic's story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 9 of the game's 57 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as 2 of the game's 7 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the game's first 3 bosses</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alexander Urban"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3191550","name":"For the Greater Good"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https: